  - name: JVM Heap Usgage
    detail: The JVM Heap usage has exceeded the 95 percent threshold
    fluxfile: flux/jvm_heap_use.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 0.95
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
    interval: 180
    target: xapi
    action: | 
              This alert indicates that the affected WLS Managed Server is suffering some kind of memory leak. 
              The managed server will most likely need to be restarted. 
